  "description": "Driven to the brink of ruin by crushing poverty and a devastating scam, Lee Do-Kyeong makes a desperate gamble. Alongside a friend, he breaks into an isolated, secluded house to steal whatever they can find. However, what awaits them inside the pitch-black mansion isn't hidden wealth, it is a gruesome trail of bloodstains and a cold, lifeless corpse. \n\nJust as paralyzing terror takes hold, an unidentified entity named Ko In-Wu emerges from the shadows. Wearing a flawless human disguise, this terrifying monster spares Do-Kyeong's life, only to force him into a twisted, coercive sexual encounter instead. \n\nWith his origins, identity, and true intentions completely shrouded in mystery, this otherworldly creature keeps Do-Kyeong ensnared. Desperate to survive, Do-Kyeong begins digging into In-Wu's secrets, only to find himself sinking deeper into a bizarre, perilous reality where every truth is darker than the last.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
